| DUO code | Label | Applies? | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| DUO:0000004 | IRB approval required | | |
| DUO:0000006 | Genetic studies only | | |
| DUO:0000007 | Disease-specific research | | |
| DUO:0000011 | Non-commercial use only | | |
| DUO:0000015 | Time limit on use | | |
| DUO:0000016 | User-specific restriction | | |
| DUO:0000018 | Institution-specific restriction | | |
| DUO:0000022 | Collaboration required | | |
| DUO:0000024 | Publication required | | |
| DUO:0000025 | Return to database or resource | | |
| DUO:0000028 | Geographical restriction | | |

When you publish the dataset, attach the matching `duo.json` codes so that
repositories, catalogs and Beacons can enforce these conditions
automatically.
